        "code": "SUCCESS",
        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "root\n |-- direccion: struct (nullable \u003d true)\n |    |-- calle: string (nullable \u003d true)\n |    |-- ciudad: string (nullable \u003d true)\n |    |-- cp: string (nullable \u003d true)\n |-- id: long (nullable \u003d true)\n |-- nombre: string (nullable \u003d true)\n |-- telefonos: array (nullable \u003d true)\n |    |-- element: string (containsNull \u003d true)\n\nexplode: Pedro (sin telefonos) desaparece\n+------+---------+\n|nombre| telefono|\n+------+---------+\n|  Juan|600111222|\n|  Juan|911234567|\n| María|600333444|\n|  Luis|600555666|\n|  Luis|600777888|\n|  Luis|911999000|\n+------+---------+\n\nexplode_outer: Pedro reaparece con NULL\n+------+---------+\n|nombre| telefono|\n+------+---------+\n|  Juan|600111222|\n|  Juan|911234567|\n| María|600333444|\n| Pedro|     NULL|\n|  Luis|600555666|\n|  Luis|600777888|\n|  Luis|911999000|\n+------+---------+\n\n"
          }
        ]
